ature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-05T09:20:16-07:00","id":1242961,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1242157#post1242157\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How did you find a group to play RPGs with? I wanna but I have nooooo friends</div> </div> </div> </div>Like with all things, the internet can help out with that. You can either set up a Play By Post on a forum (text-based, tend to move slower making them easy to keep up with) or set up a discord/whatever else for an experience more in line with in-person playing. Many forums, including those for random games, have a &quot;forum game&quot; section where you can look for players to run your game (or play other people's games, if they are running one).<br /> <br /> On this forum it is called the &quot;Conventions, Gathering, and Online Play&quot; section. Whatever other forums you are active in may be more or less active.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{