""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-10T16:55:44-07:00","id":1541895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1541876#post1541876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> You got to stop shoehorning supernatural resistance onto regular mortals</div> </div> </div> </div>Hunter with Endowment aren't really regular mortal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-10T17:31:52-07:00","id":1541898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1541895#post1541895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hunter with Endowment aren't really regular mortal.</div> </div> </div> </div>They're meant to be adjacent to it.<br /> <br /> Personally I think it depends on the chronicle. For some, it may be interesting to give Hunters this access.<br /> <br /> But by the book it seems a bit contrived. Hunter is meant for one style of play, supernatural merits are meant for another. Supernatural Resistance really isn't meant to the context of Hunter, even if we're talking Conspiracies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-10T17:46:10-07:00","id":1541900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1541895#post1541895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hunter with Endowment aren't really regular mortal.</div> </div> </div> </div>They often are. An endowment often doesn't make a human more than normal. Very few conspiracies can be said to truly make a hunter more or less human","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-10T20:17:49-07:00","id":1541910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1541900#post1541900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They often are. An endowment often doesn't make a human more than normal. Very few conspiracies can be said to truly make a hunter more or less human</div> </div> </div> </div>Some of them might not make you not more than human, but all of them absolutely count as Supernatural Merit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-10T21:01:19-07:00","id":1541911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1541910#post1541910\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Some of them might not make you not more than human, but all of them absolutely count as Supernatural Merit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not enough to give a supernatural resistance, nor &quot;absolutely&quot; a supernatural merit.<br /> <br /> Advanced Armory, Relics, Benedictions, xenotechnology just to name a few.<br /> <br /> Many of the endowments dont actually change the metaphysics of a human. It would be like saying a human should be given the magic merit because he now can do a spell from a magic book","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-10T22:57:48-07:00","id":1541914,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1541911#post1541911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not enough to give a supernatural resistance, nor &quot;absolutely&quot; a supernatural merit.<br /> <br /> Advanced Armory, Relics, Benedictions, xenotechnology just to name a few.<br /> <br /> Many of the endowments dont actually change the metaphysics of a human. It would be like saying a human should be given the magic merit because he now can do a spell from a magic book</div> </div> </div> </div>Advanced Armory give you access to Sci-Fi and even Supernatural Gadget which I think fit with the Supernatural Merit such as Assertive Implement, and Camera Obscura.<br /> <br /> Relics give you access to magical reliec which fit with the Supernatural Merit such as Blessed Amulet and Consecrate Weapon.<br /> <br /> Benediction is just magic, which I don't know how you would make that a non-supernatural merit.<br /> <br /> Xenotechnology is the same as Relics and Advanced Armory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-11T02:24:17-07:00","id":1541918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1541914#post1541914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Advanced Armory give you access to Sci-Fi and even Supernatural Gadget which I think fit with the Supernatural Merit such as Assertive Implement, and Camera Obscura.<br /> <br /> Relics give you access to magical reliec which fit with the Supernatural Merit such as Blessed Amulet and Consecrate Weapon.<br /> <br /> Benediction is just magic, which I don't know how you would make that a non-supernatural merit.<br /> <br /> Xenotechnology is the same as Relics and Advanced Armory.</div> </div> </div> </div>But these aren't supernatural merits in the sense they enhance or change the fundamental nature of the hunter. They aren't innate abilities, or work as a channel for supernatural abilities.<br /> <br /> it's not eno8gh to grant resistance. You just really seem obsessed with mortals getting that trait","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-11T02:29:44-07:00","id":1541919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1541918#post1541918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But these aren't supernatural merits in the sense they enhance or change the fundamental nature of the hunter. They aren't innate abilities, or work as a channel for supernatural abilities.<br /> <br /> it's not eno8gh to grant resistance. You just really seem obsessed with mortals getting that trait</div> </div> </div> </div>Have you look at the condition needing to unlock Supernatural Resistance Merit?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-11T04:45:25-07:00","id":1541920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1541895#post1541895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hunter with Endowment aren't really regular mortal.</div> </div> </div> </div>A hunter with an Endowment is generally nothing more or less than a hunter without an Endowment unless the Endowment grants actual supernatural abilities.<br /> However, becoming a hunter in the first place is potentially a meaningful change, considering all the changes to Integrity, Willpower, and adding Tactics. But since MtA considers hunters to be Sleepers unless they have Supernatural Merits or magical Endowments, I'm guessing becoming a hunter is actually less substantial than gaining a Supernatural Merit.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1541910#post1541910\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some of them might not make you not more than human, but all of them absolutely count as Supernatural Merit.</div> </div> </div> </div>They quite literally do not.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1541914#post1541914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Advanced Armory give you access to Sci-Fi and even Supernatural Gadget which I think fit with the Supernatural Merit such as Assertive Implement, and Camera Obscura.</div> </div> </div> </div>Advanced Armory gives you access to equipment. Camera Obscura is straight up and <i>explicitly</i> a supernatural power as it's tied to the character who can use it with literally any camera they can get their hands on.<br /> Assertive Implement can be argued to merely give you a piece of equipment, but it's implicitly tied to the character, and the fact that both Manipulation and Occult are prerequisites for it hints towards a supernatural tie between the character and the entity within the weapon.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Relics give you access to magical reliec which fit with the Supernatural Merit such as Blessed Amulet and Consecrate Weapon. </div> </div> </div>Relics gives you access to magical items. Bless Amulet and Consecrate Weapon gives you the <i>ability to create</i> magical items.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Benediction is just magic, which I don't know how you would make that a non-supernatural merit.<br /> <br /> Xenotechnology is the same as Relics and Advanced Armory. </div> </div> </div>You know what Merit Advanced Armory, Relics and Xenotechnology resembles most of all? Esoteric Armory. Unfortunately, the type of the Merit isn't described, but I'd imagine it's a social Merit like Resources and Safe Place. (Because ownership is a social construct, I guess?)<br /> <br /> You're right about Benediction being actual magic, unlike any of the other mentioned Endowments (which deals with magical items, but does not actually have the character perform any magic of their own.<br /> <br /> But this whole exercise is actually not relevant in the slightest. The crux of the problem is not whether Endowments are <i>Supernatural</i> Merits. It's whether they are <i>Merits</i> at all. And Endowments, by definition, <i>aren't</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1238403-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-hunter-edition?p=1541919#post1541919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have you look at the condition needing to unlock Supernatural Resistance Merit?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. That you need a Supernatural Merit. Which Endowments <i>are not</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /> If you want to allow Supernatural Resistance for Hunters, just straight up houserule the prerequisite to whatever you want. Here's a few suggestions:<ul><li>Mortal with at least one Supernatural Merit <i>or</i> Endowment that grants supernatural abilities (i.e. things like Benediction but not Advanced Armory)*</li> <li>Mortal with at least one Supernatural Merit <i>or</i> Endowment (i.e. any endowment at all suffices)</li> <li>Mortal with at least one Supernatural Merit <i>or</i> be a hunter (i.e. if you think being a hunter sufficiently changes you)</li> <li>Anyone who doesn't already have a Supernatural Resistance trait (i.e. accessible for all mortals, including hunters)</li> </ul>*This is my personal preference. This is how Mage distinguishes hunters that are Sleepers from hunters that are Sleepwalkers, and I find that to be a satisfying metric.<br /> <br /> There. Problem solved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":11887,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","user":"Tessie","date":". 09-11-2024, 07:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-26T02:03:16-07:00","id":1542670,"title":"","content":"With the new balancing and endowment rules, do things like Mark of the Beast (Castigation) or Kaibutsu (Seitokuken) still even have a place that warrants trying to balance them with the new rules? I already felt iffy before in 1e using Dark Eras content with modern hunter rules, but between edition changes, things like Ink feel pretty easily accounted for, but a couple Seitokuken powers (most notably Kaibutsu for me) feel really hard to try to properly balance with the everything it can do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28400-sigvardthediablerist","name":"SigvardTheDiablerist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28400_1.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}